Error [jet.ImmutableAssignment]: `k` is a loop variable, so it can't change
  --> tests/ui/iter_family_mutable_key.jet:7:9
    |
  7 |         k = "z"
    |         ^
 Why: A loop variable holds the item of the current pass, and each pass binds it afresh
 Fix: Make a changeable copy inside the loop body: `n := k`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0111

Error [jet.ImmutableAssignment]: `n` is a loop variable, so it can't change
  --> tests/ui/iter_family_mutable_key.jet:14:9
    |
 14 |         n += 10
    |         ^
 Why: A loop variable holds the item of the current pass, and each pass binds it afresh
 Fix: Make a changeable copy inside the loop body: `m := n`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0111
